1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:04,639
Say, uh, don't you keep staples
in your top desk drawer?

2
00:00:05,477 --> 00:00:06,647
(Raj:)I don't know, maybe.

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,650
(Sheldon:)Be a lamb and check.

4
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:12,613
(Sheldon:)All right.

5
00:00:15,779 --> 00:00:18,569
(Raj:)Who do we have here?

6
00:00:19,658 --> 00:00:22,328
(Sheldon:)It's a snake. A terrifying snake.

7
00:00:22,494 --> 00:00:27,164
(Raj:)Oh. Did some bad man put us
in a drawer?

8
00:00:27,374 --> 00:00:31,504
(Sheldon:)Stop talking like that.
You've been rendered speechless by fear.

9
00:00:32,337 --> 00:00:37,757
(Raj:)Let's go to the biology lab
and find you some nice yummy mice.

10
00:00:39,177 --> 00:00:42,637
I tried to scare an lndian with a snake.

11
00:00:43,181 --> 00:00:46,141
(Sheldon:)Come on, Cooper.
You're better than this.

12
00:00:49,855 --> 00:00:51,815
(Penny:)It's open.

13
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,480
- Hey, you got a minute?
- Yeah, sure. Come on in.

14
00:00:55,652 --> 00:00:57,822
- Thanks.
- Want some mac and cheese?

15
00:00:57,988 --> 00:01:01,018
(Leonard:)No. Lactose. Gas.

